{"id": "1135", "name": "Vitamin B1, B6 & B12", "slug": "vitamin-b1-b6-b12-1135", "monograph_link": "", "drug_class": "Specific combined vitamin preparations", "indication": "Vitamin B deficiencies", "indication_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">Vitamin B1, B6 &amp; B12 is indicated for the treatment of vitamin B1, B6 &amp; B12 deficiency syndrome. It is also indicated for the supportive treatment of neuritis &amp; non-inflammatory diseases of the nerves, e.g.- Diabetic neuropathy, Peripheral neuralgin, Lumbago, Myalgia, Optic neuritis, Sciatica, Facial neuralgia, Intercostal neuralgia, Spinal pain.</div>", "therapeutic_class_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">Specific combined vitamin preparations</div>", "pharmacology_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">Vitamin B1 converts carbohydrates, fatty acids and amino acids into energy, promotes healthy nerves, improves mood, strengthens the heart. Vitamin B6 forms RBCs, helps cells to make proteins, manufactures neurotransmitters e.g. serotonin and releases stored forms of energy, helps to prevent CVS diseases and stroke, helps to lift depression and eases insomnia. Vitamin B12 is essential for cell replication and important for RBC production, prevents anemia, helps to prevent depression, reduces nerve pain, numbness, tingling and lowers the risk of heart diseases.<br><br>The vitamin ingredients are absorbed well in per oral reception. It is widely distributed to most tissues and appears in breast milk. Within the cell, thiamine is mostly present as diphosphate. Thiamine is not stored to any appreciable extent in the body and amounts in excess of the body’s requirements are excreted in the urine as unchanged thiamine or as metabolites. Pyridoxine, pyridoxal and pyridoxamine are readily absorbed from the GIT following oral administration and are converted to the active forms of pyridoxal phosphate an pyridoxamine phosphate. They are stored mainly in liver where there is oxidation to 4-pyridoxic acid and other inactive metabolites, which are excreted in urine. As the dose increases, proportionally greater amounts are excreted unchanged in the urine.</div>", "dosage_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">Tablet: 1-3 Tablets per day or as advised by the physician. <br><br>Injection: <br>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>In severe (acute) cases</strong>: 1 injection daily until the acute symptoms subside or taken as advised by the physician.</li>\n<li><strong>In mild cases</strong>: 1 injection 2-3 times per week. Ampoules are preferably injected intramuscularly.</li>\n</ul>\nUse in children: There is no information on the use of this drug in children.</div>", "administration_description": "", "interaction_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">No drug interaction has been reported yet.</div>", "contraindications_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">Vitamin B1, Vitamin B6 and Vitamin B12 is contraindicated in patients on levodopa therapy, and in patients with hypersensitivity to any of the ingredients of the preparation.</div>", "side_effects_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">Generally well tolerated but allergic reactions may be observed in few cases.</div>", "pregnancy_and_lactation_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">Oral tablet form is recommended but due to the presence of benzyl alcohol, injection is not recommended during pregnancy &amp; lactation.</div>", "precautions_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">Cyanocobalamin should not be given in patients with subacute degeneration of the spinal cord. Cyanocobalamin is not suitable form of vitamin B12 for the treatment of optic neuropathies associated with raised plasma concentrations of cyanocobalamin.</div>", "pediatric_usage_description": "", "overdose_effects_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">No overdosage symptoms are to be expected in the recommended dosage. If there is known overdose then treatment is symptomatic &amp; supportive.</div>", "duration_of_treatment_description": "", "reconstitution_description": "", "storage_conditions_description": "<div class=\"ac-body\">Keep out of reach of children. Store in a cool (below 25°C temperature) and dry place, protected from light.</div>", "brands": [{"id": "293", "name": "Asibion", "slug": "asibiontablet100-mg200-mg200-mcg", "dosage_form": "Tablet", "strength": "100 mg+200 mg+200 mcg", "manufacturer": "Asiatic Laboratories Ltd.", "price": "৳ 5.00", "package_container": "Unit Price: ৳ 5.00,(50's pack: ৳ 250.00),"}, {"id": "13634", "name": "Astra-N", "slug": "astra-ntablet100-mg200-mg200-mcg", "dosage_form": "Tablet", "strength": "100 mg+200 mg+200 mcg", "manufacturer": "Astra Biopharmaceuticals Ltd.", "price": "৳ 7.00", "package_container": "Unit Price: ৳ 7.00,(15's pack: ৳ 105.00),"}, {"id": "32494", "name": "Axovit", "slug": "axovittablet100-mg200-mg200-mcg", "dosage_form": "Tablet", "strength": "100 mg+200 mg+200 mcg", "manufacturer": "Doctor TIMS Pharmaceuticals Ltd.", "price": "৳ 7.00", "package_container": "Unit Price: ৳ 7.00,(50's pack: ৳ 350.00),"}, {"id": "29241", "name": "B3", "slug": "b3tablet100-mg200-mg200-mcg", "dosage_form": "Tablet", "strength": "100 mg+200 mg+200 mcg", "manufacturer": "Al-Madina Pharmaceuticals Ltd.", "price": "৳ 7.00", "package_container": "Unit Price: ৳ 7.00,(50's pack: ৳ 350.00),"}, {"id": "13635", "name": "B126", "slug": "b126tablet100-mg200-mg200-mcg", "dosage_form": "Tablet", "strength": "100 mg+200 mg+200 mcg", "manufacturer": "Popular Pharmaceuticals Ltd.", "price": "৳ 8.00", "package_container": "Unit Price: ৳ 8.00,(60's pack: ৳ 480.00),"}, {"id": "29184", "name": "Becobion", "slug": "becobiontablet100-mg200-mg200-mcg", "dosage_form": "Tablet", "strength": "100 mg+200 mg+200 mcg", "manufacturer": "Beacon Pharmaceuticals Ltd.", "price": "৳ 8.00", "package_container": "Unit Price: ৳ 8.00,(30's pack: ৳ 240.00),"}, {"id": "13637", "name": "Berin Plus", "slug": "berin-plustablet100-mg200-mg200-mcg", "dosage_form": "Tablet", "strength": "100 mg+200 mg+200 mcg", "manufacturer": "GlaxoSmithKline", "price"